1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 12=

15
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:02,600
No!

16
00:01:05,159 --> 00:01:05,879
Zhao Feiyang.

17
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:11,040
Zhao Feiyang, how dare you?

18
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,359
Father!

19
00:01:18,439 --> 00:01:18,760
Father!

20
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,439
Qiushui.

21
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,680
(As expected of the Holy Maiden
of Tianxuan Kingdom.)

22
00:01:22,439 --> 00:01:23,680
(Her cultivation is below mine,)

23
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,400
(but she's been given countless
rare treasures,)

24
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:28,439
(and an earth-tier spirit weapon.)

25
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,000
(She can even gain a slight edge.)

26
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,599
(But I'm curious.)

27
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,280
(Against an opponent like her,)

28
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:34,599
(can I win?)

29
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:37,159
My Dao Bone is gone.

30
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:37,879
Father.

31
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:40,200
Kill him.

32
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:41,920
Avenge Father.

33
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:44,200
Kill Zhao Feiyang.

34
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,120
Father!

35
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:48,840
Father!

36
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,319
Zhao Feiyang!

37
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:53,680
For old times' sake,

38
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,319
I've tolerated you time and again.

39
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,519
I even tried to make amends.

40
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,519
Yet you destroyed my father's Dao Bone.

41
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,640
You practically killed him.

42
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,239
This is an eye for an eye.

43
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:09,719
Now you know how I felt back then.

44
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,680
If you want to avenge him,

45
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,080
come at me anytime.

46
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,280
Zhao Feiyang.

47
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,599
You jerk.

48
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,319
I'm the jerk?

49
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,159
You know I have feelings for you.

50
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,639
You know I can't bring myself
to kill you.

51
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,280
That's why you dare

52
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:30,000
to hurt and belittle me
with no fear of consequences.

53
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,199
Doesn't that make you a jerk?

54
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,719
I'm sorry.

55
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,199
After all I've been through,

56
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,680
I can no longer trust anything.

57
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,240
Three years ago,

58
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,439
my father ripped out your Dao Bone.

59
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,080
Now,

60
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,879
you've had your revenge.

61
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,919
I, Chen Qiushui, owe you nothing.

62
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,759
If our paths cross again

63
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,719
on the road of cultivation,

64
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,039
we'll be enemies.

65
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:03,840
Go.

66
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:14,639
Father.

67
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:16,759
Father!

68
00:03:17,563 --> 00:03:19,330
(Two Months Later)

69
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,520
Sword Immortal Island is far away.

70
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,719
But I'm so broke,
I have no spirit crystals.

71
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,000
I can't take a cloudship.

72
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,560
I'll have to walk.

73
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,400
You really can't get by in this world

74
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,120
without money.

75
00:03:43,418 --> 00:03:46,257
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 4)

76
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,520
Still, a blessing in disguise.

77
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:49,039
For two days, I've traveled nonstop,

78
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,240
draining and restoring my power.

79
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,919
My cultivation seems
to have improved a little again.

80
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,639
You nasty woman!

81
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:57,680
Stop right there!

82
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:58,560
Trying to run?

83
00:03:58,960 --> 00:03:59,599
After her!

84
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:01,960
Stop!

85
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:05,479
Hey, girl.

86
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:08,599
Help! No!

87
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,800
Just give in to us.

88
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:11,120
No!

89
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:14,400
No!

90
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,639
So soft.

91
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:16,920
No!

92
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,160
Stop.

93
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:22,839
Kid.

94
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:23,759
Stay out of this.

95
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:25,000
Get lost.

96
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,120
What a powerful cultivator.

97
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,120
Oh, no.

98
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,000
Scram.

99
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,040
Sir, we're sorry.

100
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,519
Sorry.

101
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,279
We're leaving.

102
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,800
Miss, are you all right?

103
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,360
Thank you for saving me.

104
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:49,519
I think I'm hurt right here.

105
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,079
Could you take a look?

106
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,680
Sure.

107
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:02,920
Come out.

108
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:05,959
Boss, you're amazing.

109
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:06,600
Of course.

110
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:09,199
How else could she take down
such a strong cultivator?

111
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,560
On the road,

112
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,000
I watched him for a long time.

113
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,839
A lone Spirit Burst Realm cultivator

114
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,160
is a rare find.

115
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,839
He must have good loot.

116
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,839
Without my Bone-Melting Powder,

117
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,079
I couldn't have taken him down.

118
00:05:22,079 --> 00:05:22,560
Exactly.

119
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,720
Search him carefully.

120
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,000
Yes, Boss.

121
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,639
Boss.

122
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,000
He's flat broke.

123
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,720
There's nothing on him.

124
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:34,399
What?

125
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:36,839
I told you to search carefully.

126
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,040
Where's his storage ring?

127
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:48,519
He doesn't have one.

128
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,360
Wait.

129
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,879
A Spirit Burst Realm cultivator

130
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,439
is actually flat broke?

131
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,360
All that flirting for nothing.

132
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,240
Rip out his Dao Bone.

133
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:04,240
He's already refined it
and fused with it.

134
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:06,000
It'd be worthless if removed.

135
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:08,959
Unbelievable.

136
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:11,000
All that acting for nothing.

137
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:11,920
Kill him.

138
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,639
So his faction won't come after us.

139
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:14,680
Yes.

140
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:42,120
You were hit by my Bone-Melting Powder.

141
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,120
How did you wake so soon?

142
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,399
This is the wilderness,

143
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,000
where wild beasts roam.

144
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:49,360
Even cultivators tread carefully.

145
00:06:49,839 --> 00:06:51,079
How could an ordinary woman

146
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:52,399
appear in a place like this?

147
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,120
So you were on guard all along.

148
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,839
Young hero, spare me.

149
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,279
Give me one more chance.

150
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,839
I'll do anything for you.

151
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,279
I can serve you.

152
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:01,759
I'm not

153
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,279
interested in you.

154
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,360
You murder people for treasure

155
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,000
and rob them of their goods.

156
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:09,639
How many cultivators
have you killed with this trick?

157
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,160
Killing you

158
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,920
won't weigh on my conscience.

159
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:16,360
No!

160
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:27,920
A storage ring?

161
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,680
Every cultivator needs one.

162
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,000
I was worried I couldn't afford one.

163
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,800
Who knew

164
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,519
someone would deliver it to me?

165
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:38,759
It seems to be high-grade too.

166
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,720
Let's see what's inside.

167
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,160
So many treasures.

168
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,480
This could rival

169
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,680
an entire sect's reserves.

170
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,160
My luck is finally turning.

171
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,160
At last, I'm no longer

172
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:13,839
so broke even bandits look down on me.

173
00:08:14,636 --> 00:08:17,183
(Sword Immortal Inn)

174
00:08:17,297 --> 00:08:19,363
(Sword Immortal Inn)

175
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:22,160
(Cloud, Rank, Moon, Earth)

176
00:08:27,151 --> 00:08:27,791
Well.

177
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,560
What a coincidence.

178
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,759
I didn't expect to meet

179
00:08:29,879 --> 00:08:31,720
Junior Sister Qin of the Qingyun Sect

180
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,360
and Senior Brother Liang
of the Tianwu Sect here.

181
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:37,200
Sword Immortal Inn is the last stop

182
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,440
and the closest inn to the island.

183
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,960
We're heading there,

184
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,639
so naturally we'll rest here.

185
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:44,039
Holy Son, please sit.

186
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:45,000
Join us for tea.

187
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,159
Sure.

188
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:46,960
I'll get a room.

189
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,559
Innkeeper.

190
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,159
Heaven Room One, please.

191
00:08:51,290 --> 00:08:52,650
(Mo Chen, Sword Immortal Innkeeper)

192
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,320
Sir.

193
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,200
Welcome.

194
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:58,639
Welcome, sir.

195
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:01,519
Heaven Room One

196
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:03,480
costs 1,000 spirit crystals.

197
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,000
What?

198
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,000
1,000 spirit crystals?

199
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,360
That's robbery.

200
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,240
Robbery?

201
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:09,799
In that case,

202
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,919
this must be your first visit

203
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:12,639
to Sword Immortal Inn.

204
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:15,519
This inn sits atop a spirit vein.

205
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:18,279
It greatly benefits cultivators,

206
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,399
especially the Heaven Rooms.

207
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:22,519
So 1,000 spirit crystals

208
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,759
for a Heaven Room

209
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,480
isn't expensive at all.

210
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,240
Sir.

211
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,000
Here.

212
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,320
Thank you.

213
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,600
Waiter.

214
00:09:38,039 --> 00:09:38,639
- Coming!
- Come here.

215
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,480
One Heaven Room.

216
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,039
This way, sir.

217
00:09:42,759 --> 00:09:43,279
This way.

218
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:52,879
One Heaven Room, please.

219
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,480
Certainly.

220
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,759
Waiter, come here.

221
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,759
One Heaven Room.

222
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,639
Qiushui, you're here too.

223
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,440
It's been a while.

224
00:10:01,639 --> 00:10:02,799
I have so much to tell you.

225
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,960
Come, sit here.

226
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,159
Enjoy, sir.

227
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,080
Qiushui.

228
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:13,679
Innkeeper.

229
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,120
One Heaven Room, please.

230
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:19,960
Of course.

231
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,000
Enough?

232
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,559
Yes.

233
00:10:34,399 --> 00:10:35,679
One Heaven Room.

234
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,759
This way, miss.

235
00:10:37,050 --> 00:10:37,876
(Heaven Room One)

236
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:39,840
Young lady,

237
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,960
you have a remarkable aura,

238
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,240
yet you look familiar.

239
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:43,759
May I ask

240
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,440
which family you're from?

241
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,320
The Heavenly Sword Sect's chief disciple

242
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:50,399
and its young sect master.

243
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:56,559
So you're the one born
with a divine-grade Dao Bone.

244
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,720
The Heavenly Sword Sect's
Young Sect Master.

245
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:00,799
Greetings, Holy Maiden.

246
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,480
And this is...?

247
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:04,080
I...

248
00:11:05,759 --> 00:11:07,960
I'm Jiang Cheng,
Holy Son of Nanyuan Kingdom.

249
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,559
The other two are

250
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,320
my friends.

251
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,840
Liang Wu, chief disciple
of the Tianwu Sect.

252
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:18,200
Qin Lan, chief disciple
of the Qingyun Sect.

253
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,639
I'm Cuihua. Greetings, everyone.

254
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:23,399
What a fine day.

255
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,960
All the Southern Domain's prodigies
are gathered here.

256
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,080
What a coincidence.

257
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,120
Drinks are on me tonight.

258
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:29,759
How about it?

259
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,279
We're all here

260
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:33,600
for Sword Immortal Island.

261
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:36,279
The island opens every seven years.

262
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:39,159
It's no surprise we're all here.

263
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:41,320
Qiushui.

264
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:42,879
Why rain on my parade?

265
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,399
The Holy Maiden is right.

266
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,919
We're gathered here

267
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,120
to reach the island

268
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,399
and receive guidance
from the Sword Immortals.

269
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:49,159
However,

270
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,360
the three Sword Immortals only guide
those destined to learn from them.

271
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:54,120
That makes us all rivals.

272
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,240
Besides, I don't drink.

273
00:11:56,799 --> 00:11:57,720
I don't want to drink either.

274
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,120
All right, then.

275
00:12:01,799 --> 00:12:03,080
We're all here now.

276
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,039
I doubt anyone else will come.

277
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:07,200
We may be rivals,

278
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:08,440
but

279
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:11,360
we can still exchange
cultivation insights, right?

280
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:13,679
Then we'll go together tomorrow.

281
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,919
No objections, right?

282
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,240
Let's go.

283
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:19,960
Come.

284
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:20,480
Please.

285
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:22,840
Any rooms left?

286
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:27,919
We all seem acquainted.

287
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:29,440
What a coincidence.

288
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,240
Zhao Feiyang.

289
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,679
What are you doing here?

290
00:12:36,933 --> 00:12:40,563
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

291
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:43,390
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

292
00:12:43,650 --> 00:12:47,200
♪Then came my fall, with frost
and snow on my shoulders♪

293
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:51,580
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

294
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:55,280
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

295
00:12:55,650 --> 00:12:58,460
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

296
00:12:58,770 --> 00:13:02,150
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

297
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:06,510
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

298
00:13:06,950 --> 00:13:10,080
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

299
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:13,450
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

300
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:16,860
♪With this flesh and soul♪

301
00:13:17,090 --> 00:13:20,110
♪I shall forge a new age♪

302
00:13:20,447 --> 00:13:23,517
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

303
00:13:23,767 --> 00:13:26,857
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

304
00:13:27,077 --> 00:13:29,307
♪At cultivation's peak♪

305
00:13:29,447 --> 00:13:33,287
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

306
00:13:33,697 --> 00:13:36,317
♪The sun and moon turn♪

307
00:13:36,337 --> 00:13:40,007
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

308
00:13:40,467 --> 00:13:47,247
♪I am the undying flame♪

309
00:13:47,927 --> 00:13:52,647
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

310
00:13:52,997 --> 00:13:56,177
♪At last I see, immortality♪

311
00:13:56,337 --> 00:14:00,977
♪Lives in your smiles♪
